lsdyna keyword
c Fine core octant: 4 x 4 x 4 cells, spacing 0.5.
block 1 5;1 5;1 5;0 2;0 2;0 2;
bb 2 1 1 2 2 2 1;
bb 1 2 1 2 2 2 2;
bb 1 1 2 2 2 2 3;
endpart

c Coarse +X face block. Transition on x-min; export lateral walls.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;2 4;0 2;0 2;
trbb 1 1 1 1 2 2 1;
bb 1 2 1 2 2 2 4;
bb 1 1 2 2 2 2 5;
endpart

c Coarse +Y face block. Transition on y-min; export lateral walls.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;0 2;2 4;0 2;
trbb 1 1 1 2 1 2 2;
bb 2 1 1 2 2 2 6;
bb 1 1 2 2 2 2 7;
endpart

c Coarse +Z face block. Transition on z-min; export lateral walls.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;0 2;0 2;2 4;
trbb 1 1 1 2 2 1 3;
bb 2 1 1 2 2 2 8;
bb 1 2 1 2 2 2 9;
endpart

c +X+Y edge block. Transition on both inward faces.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;2 4;2 4;0 2;
trbb 1 1 1 1 2 2 6;
trbb 1 1 1 2 1 2 4;
bb 1 1 2 2 2 2 10;
endpart

c +X+Z edge block. Transition on both inward faces.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;2 4;0 2;2 4;
trbb 1 1 1 1 2 2 8;
trbb 1 1 1 2 2 1 5;
bb 1 2 1 2 2 2 11;
endpart

c +Y+Z edge block. Transition on both inward faces.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;0 2;2 4;2 4;
trbb 1 1 1 2 1 2 9;
trbb 1 1 1 2 2 1 7;
bb 2 1 1 2 2 2 12;
endpart

c +X+Y+Z corner block. Transition on all three inward faces.
block 1 3;1 3;1 3;2 4;2 4;2 4;
trbb 1 1 1 1 2 2 12;
trbb 1 1 1 2 1 2 11;
trbb 1 1 1 2 2 1 10;
endpart

merge
stp 0.000001
mof D:/AI_Tools/HexRefine/docs/trbb_evidence/local_box_corner_2to1.k;
write
exit
